A narrow student's cell under a sloped ceiling: a bed with unfamiliar sheets, a desk, a trunk you have not finished unpacking. Moonlight through the single lancet window finds the door to the north, standing just ajar.
Exits: north.
You see: candle, wand.
> You step forward. A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

A key lies on the floor. The corridor runs north and south, and a way leads up.
Exits: north, south, up.
You see: key.
HP: 12/12 · Stun: ready · Ward: ready
> A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

A goblin grunt lunges from the dark and strikes at you. Then it draws back, shoulder rolling, the next blow plain in its stance before it comes. You slip aside and land a chipping hit that barely dents it.

On the floor, a key catches the lamplight. The way lies open north, south, and up.
HP: 11/12 · Stun: ready · Ward: ready
> The goblin grunt lunges, blade swinging for your side. You turn the blow and drive back hard, and the creature folds, still at last.

A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

North and up lie open beyond the lamplight. On the floor rest a key and a fire grimoire.
> The stair from the corridor climbs to a broad half-landing where the steps double back on themselves, the old creak you heard below now living under your own feet. Moonlight falls grey through a tall reglazed arrow slit, laying a pale bar across worn treads and the carved newel post at the turn. A Vigil Lamp warms to brass life above the window, and the stair continues up into deeper dark, while a low arch opens west onto a shadowed gallery. This far out from the school's heart the quiet is only the quiet of night, unbroken and undisturbed.
Exits: down, up, west.
